801.41;+25224,;25~WP-start~14
MONITORING AND RISK ASSESSMENT\\
\\
The purpose of the skin inspection/assessment is to record detailed 
information around patient's/resident's skin and wound 
inspection/assessment findings.\\
\\The goal is for clear, descriptive, and reportable documentation 
identifying skin/wound areas needing high quality evidenced informed
care.\\
\\The skin inspection/assessment template should be completed every 24 
hours, change in condition or pressure ulcers/injury risk scale and/or in 
accordance with procedures outlined for all settings in Directive 1352, 
Prevention and Management of Pressure Injuries.\\
{FLD:VA VANOD VHA DIRECTIVE 1352}
{FLD:VA VANOD PREVENTING PRESSURE ULCER IN HOSPITAL}
