801.41;+2502,;25~WP-start~7
Unstageable Pressure Injury\\
Full-thickness skin and tissue loss in which the extent of tissue damage 
within the ulcer cannot be confirmed because it is obscured by slough or 
eschar. If slough or eschar is removed, a Stage 3 or Stage 4 pressure 
injury will be revealed. Stable eschar (i.e. dry, adherent, intact 
without erythema or fluctuance) on the heel or ischemic limb should not 
be softened or removed.
801.41;+2502,;35~WP-start~2
